docs {
  # Post Dividend

  Creates or updates a dividend calendar entry.

  Accepts a single dividend object or an array of objects.

  ## Fields

  | Field           | Type   | Required | Description                                  |
  |-----------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------|
  | name            | string | yes      | Company name                                 |
  | symbol          | string | yes      | Security type / symbol (e.g. COMMON, ACENB)  |
  | dividend_type   | string | yes      | "Cash", "Stock", "Property", etc.            |
  | dividend_rate   | string | yes      | Raw rate string (e.g. "Php25 per share")     |
  | ex_date         | string | yes      | Ex-dividend date (YYYY-MM-DD)                |
  | record_date     | string | yes      | Record date (YYYY-MM-DD)                     |
  | payment_date    | string | no       | Payment date (YYYY-MM-DD), nullable          |
  | circular_number | string | no       | PSE circular number (e.g. "C05886-2026")     |
}
